# Whitelist mode: ignore everything by default, then allow only tracked
# config back in. Runtime files pi keeps under agent/ (sessions, caches,
# crash logs, managed install, bin shim, node data, ...) stay out of the
# repo automatically — no per-file ignore list to maintain.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/agent/

agent/*
!agent/AGENTS.md
!agent/models.json
!agent/settings.json
!agent/extensions/
!agent/skills/
!agent/themes/
